WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-12 - The Pasco Lock
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:39.500
White tiled walls and a buzzing light

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.800
A heavy door, locked up so tight

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.500
My body's weak, my needs are clear

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.100
But that's not why you brought me here

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:54.200
The hunger's gnawing, thirst is real

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.200
But all I'm ever forced to feel

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:02.500
Is the chilling echo in this space

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:07.356
And the rising fury on your face

00:01:08.296 --> 00:01:12.800
Just let me be invisible

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:16.800
Just let me crawl under a stone

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:20.344
Your voice is a razor, indivisible

00:01:20.464 --> 00:01:25.200
Just leave me, leave me all alone

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:30.200
Inside this Pasco lock and key

00:01:31.038 --> 00:01:36.532
There's no escape, no way to flee

00:01:41.574 --> 00:01:45.500
And now the screaming finally starts

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:49.500
Tearing all my seams apart

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:53.200
It's all my fault, this whole cursed trip

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.937
The poison dripping from your lip

00:01:56.037 --> 00:01:59.758
The walls are closing, tile and steel

00:01:59.918 --> 00:02:04.359
This nightmare's finally getting real

00:02:04.479 --> 00:02:07.500
You blame my chair, you blame my needs

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.021
You're planting bitter, hateful seeds

00:02:14.362 --> 00:02:18.800
Just let me be invisible

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.800
Just let me crawl under a stone

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.385
Your voice is a razor, indivisible

00:02:26.525 --> 00:02:31.200
Just leave me, leave me all alone

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:36.200
Inside this Pasco lock and key

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:42.458
There's no escape, no way to flee

00:02:42.800 --> 00:03:22.000
[Instrumental Bridge: Chaotic Industrial Break]

